@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` to report, per configured beacon, when it last actually
+executed and whether that execution produced an error, so operators can check
+beacon health across a fleet without reading minion logs. Beacons that have not
+fired yet are reported with a ``last_run`` of ``None``.
